  "description": "<p>This personalized doormat is designed to create a warm and inviting atmosphere, perfect for welcoming students into any classroom. Featuring a composition notebook style, this doormat offers a unique touch that is both charming and functional. It serves as a special decorative element and helps keep spaces clean.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalize with a teacher's name for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>Soft and durable non-woven fabric top.</li>\n<li>Neoprene rubber non-slip backing for stability.</li>\n<li>Effectively traps dirt, dust, and grime.</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor use.</li>\n<li>Washable and easy to clean.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Composition Notebook Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Classroom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Text Input</td>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Avoid bleaching</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Hose down or sponge clean with mild liquid soap</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Drying</td>\n<td>Air dry</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is ideal for classrooms, entryways, and RVs, making it suitable for various indoor and outdoor settings. Its design complements educational environments and can also enhance other welcoming spaces.</p>",
